---- wgmma_vs_cublas: correctness, before a single timed launch ----
The guard shape is derived from the config: 3x3 CTAs, ktiles = stages+1 (one producer wrap),
ragged in M AND N AND K, and an ODD tile count so a future persistent tile loop's partial last
wave is reachable. Two arms: exact integers at `==` (a permutation diagnostic, invariant under any
reassociation and therefore blind to every scheduler change coming), and pseudorandom operands
against an independent f64 reference at c*sqrt(K)*eps*sum|a*b| -- the arm that CAN see one -- run twice
and demanded bit-identical.
